Package: seqpatch
Type: Package
Title: Practical Patches for RNA-seq Count Data Analysis
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person(given = "Jianqiang", family = "Sun",
    email = "sun@bitdessin.dev",
    role = c("cre", "aut"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3438-3199"))
Description: Provides a compact toolkit for analyzing bulk RNA-seq count data.
    Its core features include normalization based on the differentially
    expressed gene elimination strategy (DEGES), which reduces the influence
    of candidate differentially expressed genes when estimating sample-specific
    scaling factors. The package also provides visualization functions and
    count data simulation utilities for methodological evaluation.
